== #text(green)[Degree Apprenticeships]
- Start working immediately at a company. Usually one day a week at university, studying for a tech-related degree #pause
- Harder to get into than University as fewer places available#pause
- All have different application processes at different times of the year#pause
- Need to do university work in evenings and weekend

== #text(green)[Degree Apprenticeships]
#text(21pt)[#grid(columns:(1fr,1fr),
[
  *Advantages*
  #uncover("1-")[
    - Don’t need extremely high academic grades. However, you do need to be able to demonstrate your passion and ability to be a good employee
  ]
  #uncover("3-")[
    - Get into a career faster. Start accruing work experience immediately.
  ]
  #uncover("5-")[
    - Get paid
    - No student debt from loans
    - Get a degree
  ]
  
],[
  *Disadvantages*
  #uncover("2-")[
    - Very hard to get into
    - Degree usually has relatively low reputation on its own
  ]
  #uncover("4-")[
    - Usually very involved application process \ (interviews and assessment days)
  ]
  #uncover("6-")[
    - Wage can be very low (does vary amongst employers)
  ]
])]

